sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Engineer (API client)
  participant R as router
  participant C as Catalog (PostgreSQL)
  participant OS as OpenSearch
  participant D as DuckDB
  participant S as Object store
  participant M as dlm

  U->>R: GET /api/v1/search?q=neptune&from=T1&to=T2
  R->>C: partitions overlapping [T1, T2]
  C-->>R: P1 HOT idx-a, P2 WARM idx-b, P3 COLD manifest-c
  par HOT and WARM
    R->>OS: _search idx-a,idx-b (timeout 5 s)
    OS-->>R: hits
  and COLD
    R->>D: read_parquet(files of manifest-c) WHERE time and text
    D->>S: ranged GETs (row groups skipped by statistics)
    S-->>D: column chunks
    D-->>R: rows (timeout 20 s)
  end
  Note over M,C: Meanwhile P2 is switched from WARM to COLD
  M->>C: UPDATE tier=COLD, location=manifest-d, version+1
  Note over R,OS: idx-b is kept for the purge grace period, so this query stays correct
  R->>R: merge by event_time, remove duplicates by event_id
  R->>C: INSERT query_audit (tiers, latency, status)
  R-->>U: hits + per-tier latency + COMPLETE or PARTIAL
